<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><head><meta charset=UTF-8><title><%= title %></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/terminal.css"></head>
<body><div class="terminal-container"><div class="terminal-header"><span class="terminal-title">[A04] Coupon Abuse</span></div>
<div class="terminal-body fade-in">
<h1>Coupon Business Logic</h1>
<form method="POST" action="/insecure-design/apply-coupon">
  <input name="price" placeholder="Price" value="100">
  <input name="code" placeholder="Coupon code">
  <button>Apply</button>
</form>
<p class="hint">Try: <code>SUMMER50</code>, <code>FLAT10</code>, <code>FREE</code>. Same coupon can apply multiple times.</p>
<p>Also try <code>POST /insecure-design/bulk-order</code> with array bypass.</p></div></div></body></html>